<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent gangs are stealing thousands of homes in Mexico City while a Gulf Cartel leader's arrest has reignited fighting in northern Mexico, and a mayor who opposed cartels was assassinated, prompting his son’s detention and a brief halt of trucker protests that later resumed after talks with authorities. Federal agents indicted engineer Luis Manuel Hernandez Victoria for constructing a 1,900‑foot cross-border drug tunnel and filed terrorism charges, and a large drug operation was uncovered in San Diego County. A 7‑year-old American girl was among six dead in cartel violence in Matamoros. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE54RmFYMXExS0NodS1pZnNBWko5bEhIS3FPVkJvZkpPS2J2MXd6RjNqaWdOVlF6dVhsZVlDdXU5a3JLWm1WY2RjcldWMjJfNjJtNHdXS195bmJvLVFybnR1ajBwb0lJRGRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNYVByUm1XWmJEYmlxaGJoNHNvWnpIWkVKZU5FbHhacFprUVM0OG1Kal9yQ1VrdG53VUNTZWJmOFNDVFR0dmRQXzUwODAxcUtBOUxDNF9VSnMxdDNMdzZIUDNRdUhrQ3VLb0MzU3YwdlR4YTdWMEJCS3B0RFl0TVo0OWNUd1NNbkctZlltckJwUER5YzExaW8zWjFNMG1abFFVZ3R6WmlRdEl5Qkx5QjB1Z0FqOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQWS1CNmxOSjRTN19MSjRSNUFBUWdtV2hLUlJBd21jd0RwMG5mTjZyc3JDT3dmUG5PNWVVTUhYbWotQVFEWTFjd3hvS3haOTdObjctT1ZaSXRVMmttejY0SE5PTFFKaDBIcG9VbWRYR2c4SnZkNlVZUGZtNmxHcDAtSTc3a0E5MWdWWDBYdklEZ1RqMjRnbXZoempKLTBCYUlHRUFWZWdKRTFxV1BPejFmSlZLdW83RUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNcTlLVHVpeTdEQWxTSmFrZ1RFQ2ZsRjZuRkhTeDdhOU12RnJldkNMdjJhcDBEaGVrZmU0a3pFT2owUlUzWUlpTVdBOTdOUUxxR1BacHBP